{
  "$comment": "Spec 53 runtime-family conformance vectors (B-T06A, feature IW-RT-006). Advertisement/admission cases follow spec 48; native-endpoint smoke vectors follow spec 49 and must name a path in openapi/inferweave-v1.yaml. conformance/runner.py reports per-family pass/fail.",
